      "gebeurtenis": "taal_na_skrywer",
      "punte": [
        "fix: [taal] in 'Mense hier maak': 'Mense hier' is vague in a printed text.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Nie alles wat jy insit kom weer as klank by jou uit nie. Klank is daar': 'Daarom' can read as a non sequitur (not all input becomes sound, therefore sound is the main output); it is defensible if the point is 'main, not only', so I have not changed it, but a writer may want a clearer link. Also 'by jou uit' is odd: the sound comes out of the instrument, not out at you.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Sit nou een vinger op dieselfde rekkie op dieselfde blik.': The doubled 'dieselfde ... op dieselfde' is wooden, but rewording it cleanly would mean choosing what to stress (same band, still on the tin), which is the writer's call."
